sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Player as Người chơi
    participant Mikasa as mikasa<br/>Spring Boot
    participant MariaDB as MariaDB<br/>plugin_dir
    participant Plugin as rpl.so / r.sh
    participant Bot as internalbot<br/>Puppeteer
    participant Web as web<br/>Node.js + WASM
    participant Hook as Webhook

    Player->>Mikasa: Upload rpl.so và r.sh qua /upload
    Mikasa->>MariaDB: Ghi file vào /home/ctf/lib/plugins/
    Player->>Mikasa: SQLi /search<br/>INSTALL SONAME 'rpl'
    Mikasa->>MariaDB: Thực thi stacked query
    MariaDB->>Plugin: Load rpl.so
    Plugin->>Plugin: Chạy /home/ctf/lib/plugins/r.sh trong mikasa
    Plugin->>Bot: POST http://internalbot:8000/visit<br/>comment = padding + XSS
    Bot->>Web: Mở web và submit comment dài
    Web->>Web: go.argv ghi đè CONTENT_CACHE
    Web->>Web: processed_post_content trở thành HTML
    Bot->>Web: Render lại feed
    Web-->>Bot: innerHTML kích hoạt Stored XSS
    Bot->>Hook: Gửi document.cookie